    {
      "text": "2022 NOP: San Bruno Park School District owns the site; Pulte Homes (applicant) has a purchase agreement. The site holds the San Bruno Golf Center driving range and a school district maintenance building. Plans include two pocket parks, a community park, a Crestmoor Canyon trailhead and storm drain upgrades; access from Sneath Lane via a widened Engvall Court.",
      "src": [
